---
# Base C++ modernisation configuration.
# Project-specific suppressions belong below this comment.
Checks: >
  modernize-*,
  readability-*,
  bugprone-*,
  performance-*,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -readability-magic-numbers,
  -readability-named-parameter
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: ''
FormatStyle: file
